  "body": "At the moment, a (shared)worker's lifecycle is linked to [related documents](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/workers.html#active-needed-worker), but these should be creatable within a service worker to do things such as image processing, expensive diffing etc without locking up the service worker.\n\nI imagine this means changing [the worker's documents](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/workers.html#the-worker's-documents) to be the worker's clients, where clients can be documents or service workers.\n\nPrevious discussion https://github.com/slightlyoff/ServiceWorker/issues/678\n",
